        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>A FENRIS reduced to 0 Hit Points is not destroyed. Its legs lock and it drops where it stands, becoming an inert obstacle: it cannot act, has AC 12, and is <strong>unconscious</strong> for the purpose of effects that target creatures.</p><p>The chassis stays live. Any damage dealt to it triggers <strong>Post-Mortem Explosion</strong>.</p>",
