        },
        "actions": {
          "value": null
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A deactivated FENRIS takes damage of any kind.</p><hr /><p>The power cell lets go in a <strong>10-foot emanation</strong>. Each creature in the area takes @Damage[2d6[electricity]] with a @Check[reflex|dc:17|basic] save. On a critical failure a creature is also knocked <strong>prone</strong>, which will put most targets out of cover.</p><p>The mech is destroyed. A FENRIS taken apart while inactive, or reduced to 0 Hit Points by an effect that leaves no chassis behind, never gets to use this reaction.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
